#: processes/swot-analysis.bpmn:107
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "A SEPARATE end event rather than a short-circuit into the other, because the two are different facts for a reader: \"a situation was analysed and nothing was being decided\" is not \"an analysis fed a decision\". Collapsing them would leave nobody able to tell a standing scan from one whose handoff was forgotten."
msgstr ""

